+## [1.1.0] - 2026-07-10
+
+### Added
+- Bulk import endpoints: `POST /invoices/bulk` (JSON) and `POST /invoices/bulk-csv` (CSV body)
+- CSV export endpoint: `GET /export/csv` with computed tax/outstanding columns
+- New analytics endpoints: average-invoice-amount, average-days-to-pay, top-currencies,
+  overdue-by-supplier, size-distribution, payment-performance
