+- `PATCH /invoices/{n}` accepts `amount_paid=0` and auto-derives payment status
+- Deprecated `@app.on_event("startup")` replaced with lifespan context manager
+- `__main__` entrypoint moved to end of main.py (was mid-file)
+- Duplicate filter logic in summary/view-selector endpoints replaced with shared helper
+
 ## [1.0.0] - 2026-06-11
 
 ### Added
